# Private operator inputs: the maintainer copies to .env.deploy in the checkout root
# (mode 0600) and fills it before any operator task. Never commit it; never use
# another consumer's credentials. Application secrets go in
# .env.<environment> (see deploy/k8s/.env.<environment>.example), not here.
# Human-mode tasks read supported credential keys automatically.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
# Optional registry credential:
REGISTRY_TOKEN=
# Export probe origins explicitly or put them in the private profile/probes.json;
# automatic credential loading does not import these keys. Rename PROJECT_* before
# first publication.
@PROBE_KEYS@